  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The numbers",
   "texto": [
    "From 0 to 16 you have to learn them by memory. From 17 to 19 they form adding: **dix-sept** (diez-seven), **dix-huit**, **dix-neuf**.",
    "In isolated **six** and **dix**, the **x** sounds / s / («sis», «dis»); in **dix-huit** and **dix-neuf**, it sounds / z /. **p** of **sept** is not pronounced. In this guide, **Z** represents / z / (a «s» sonora, not the Spanish z)."
   ]
